{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/similar/high/h1/1mid/26_매산여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사.js", "sourceOrdinal": 1, "sourceId": 1, "uid": null, "sourceCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "sourceBlobSha": "2b703a3a31e96ac60ba915aab1df4b3ad8af9c91"}, "scope": "similar", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "productionLedgerState": null, "checkedCommit": "c57e1a1ca788ead8754db175ff0a8bc20fe158f0", "visualReview": "NOT_REVIEWED", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "KEEP", "solution": "EXEMPT", "why": "다항식 뺄셈의 계수 추출."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/similar/high/h1/1mid/26_매산여고_1학기_중간_고1_유사/_decisions.jsonl", "files": [], "capability": null, "status": "NOT_STARTED", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "다항식 뺄셈의 계수 추출.", "auxiliaryLines": [], "intermediateValues": [], "correspondingMarks": [], "hiddenAnswerValues": [], "sourceEvidence": "$2A-B$를 전개하여 필요한 계수를 찾는다.\n$2A=2(2x^3-x^2+2x-1)$\n$=4x^3-2x^2+4x-2$\n따라서\n$2A-B$\n$=(4x^3-2x^2+4x-2)-(x^3+2x^2-5x+4)$\n$=4x^3-2x^2+4x-2-x^3-2x^2+5x-4$\n$=3x^3-4x^2+9x-6$\n$x$항의 계수는 $9$,\n$x^2$항의 계수는 $-4$이므로\n$9+(-4)=5$\n따라서 정답은 ③이다."}, "checks": {"answerHidden": null, "midValuesKept": null, "coordsVerified": null, "captionNamesPresent": null, "visualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": null}}
